Description:
You’re given a seemingly ordinary JPG image. Something is tucked away out of sight inside the file. 
Your task is to discover the hidden payload and extract the flag.Download the jpg image here and read 
its metadata.

---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Approach:
On looking up the metada for img.jpg we find that the comment looks different on decoding it in Cyberchef
we see an output steghide:cEF6endvcmQ=  on decoding the base64 we found the output as "pAzzword" we then install
steghide on our webshell and use the command steghide extract -sf "img.jpg" -p "pAzzword" which then generates the
flag for our ctf in flag.txt

---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Solution:
picoCTF{h1dd3n_1n_1m4g3_656e4d79}
